{"ref":"BDB, עַמּוֹן","hw":"עַמּוֹן","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַמּוֹן</span></big><sub>106</sub>  <strong>n. pr. gent. Ammon</strong>, 𝔊 Αμμαν, Αμμων <strong>(</strong>Assyrian <em>Bît Ammanu</em> COT<sup>Gloss.</sup><strong>)</strong>;—always (except <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.11\">1 S 11:11</a> [where however 𝔊 reads <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי ע׳</span>], <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:8\" href=\"/Psalms.83.8\">ψ 83:8</a>, which have <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> alone) <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי עַמּוֹן</span>, connected by J with <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־עַמִּי</span> son of Lot <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:38\" href=\"/Genesis.19.38\">Gn 19:38</a> (and meaning of name doubtless sought herein by J; cf. ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עַם³\" href=\"/BDB,_עַם³\", dir=\"rtl\">עַם</a>); people apparently akin to Isr., but usually hostile, dwelling E. of Jordan, NE. of Moab, between Arnon and Jabbok: <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:24\" href=\"/Numbers.21.24\">Nu 21:24</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.19\">Dt 2:19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:37\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.11\">3:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:2\" href=\"/Joshua.12.2\">Jos 12:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:10\" href=\"/Joshua.13.10\">13:10</a> (D), v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:25\" href=\"/Joshua.13.25\">25</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:13\" href=\"/Judges.3.13\">Ju 3:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:6\" href=\"/Judges.10.6\">10:6</a> + 25 times <a data-ref=\"Judges 10-12\" href=\"/Judges.10-12\">Ju 10–12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.11\">1 S 11:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.12\">12:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:47\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.47\">14:47</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.12\">2 S 8:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.1\">10:1</a> + 14 times <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10-12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10-12\">2 S 10–12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.27\">17:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.7\">1 K 11:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:33\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.33\">33</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.13\">2 K 23:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.2\">24:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.11\">1 Ch 18:11</a> + 20 times Ch, <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:13\" href=\"/Amos.1.13\">Am 1:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.14\">Is 11:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.25\">Je 9:25</a> + 9 times Je, <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:8\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.8\">Zp 2:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:9\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.25\">Ez 21:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:33\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.33\">33</a> + 5 times <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25\">Ez 25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:41\" href=\"/Daniel.11.41\">Dn 11:41</a>.—Vid. Che<sup>Ammon</sup> in Ency. Bib.","next":"BDB, עַמּוֹנִי","prev":"BDB, עֻמָּה²"}